<back><div type="verses">
<lg><l>Ears that hear, they’re so dear!</l><l>Nose to smell, very well!</l><l>And two eyes taking pictures constantly. (click, click)</l><l>With my mouth I can feed,</l><l>Drink and sing, pray and read</l><l>Thank You, Lord, You made me</l><l>Wonderf’lly!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
